.</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 md:py-28 px-6 bg-neutral-50 bg-shades"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-6" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)">The Problem: Walmart Has No Bulk Delete</h2><p class="text-base text-neutral-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)">Walmart&#x27;s seller dashboard doesn&#x27;t include a bulk delete feature. If you need to remove dozens or hundreds of listings (whether for seasonal cleanup, inventory adjustments, or catalog reorganization), you&#x27;re stuck deleting one by one. A single listing deletion takes 30 seconds. Multiply that by 50 listings and you&#x27;ve lost an hour clicking the same buttons over and over.</p><p class="text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)">The bulk delete tool from Ecom Circles solves this. Select all the listings you want to remove, set filters if needed, and delete them in seconds. It works right in your Walmart seller account and is updated for the current Walmart interface.</p></div></section><section class="py-20 md:py-28 px-6 bg-shades"><div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6"><div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-8 text-center hover:shadow-md transition-shadow" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#6172F3]/10 mx-auto mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trash2 lucide-trash-2 h-6 w-6 text-[#6172F3]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 11v6"></path><path d="M14 11v6"></path><path d="M19 6v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6"></path><path d="M3 6h18"></path><path d="M8 6V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"></path></svg>