uto text-center mb-16 leading-relaxed" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)">The bulk delete tool integrates into your Walmart seller dashboard. Select the listings you want to remove, optionally filter by category or price, review your selection, and confirm deletion. All in one place.</p><div class="relative"><div class="absolute left-6 top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-[#6172F3] via-[#EC4899] to-[#EC4899]"></div><div class="relative flex gap-8 pb-12 last:pb-0" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="relative z-10 flex h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white border-2 border-[#6172F3] text-[#6172F3] font-bold text-lg shadow-sm">1</div><div class="pt-2"><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900">Log Into Walmart Seller Central</h3><p class="mt-2 text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Access your Walmart seller account as usual. The bulk delete tool appears in your Listings tab.</p></div></div><div class="relative flex gap-8 pb-12 last:pb-0" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="relative z-10 flex h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white border-2 border-[#6172F3] text-[#6172F3] font-bold text-lg shadow-sm">2</div><div class="pt-2"><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900">Select Listings to Delete</h3><p class="mt-2 text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Check the boxes next to the listings you want to remove. You can select a few or dozens at once.</p></div></div><div class="relative flex gap-8 pb-12 last:pb-0" style="opacity:1;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="relative z-10 flex h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white border-2 border-[#6172F3] text-[#6172F3] font-bold text-lg shadow-sm">3</div><div class="pt-2"><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-900">Apply Filters (Optional)</h3><p class="mt-2 text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed">Filter by category, price range, or status to narrow your selection. Skip this